        "\"QuestionResult\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"One question's totals. `choice`: selections per option. `ranking`: per option, how many ballots placed it at each position (index 0 = first). `score`: per option, the sum and the number of ballots that scored it. `text`: the answers, in board order, withheld (`withheld: true`) below the manifest's `textReleaseThreshold`. `abstained` counts ballots that left the question unanswered.\",\"properties\":{\"abstained\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"choice\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"propertyNames\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/Key\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"question\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/Key\"},\"ranking\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"items\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"propertyNames\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/Key\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"score\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"count\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"sum\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"sum\",\"count\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"propertyNames\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/Key\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"text\":{\"items\":{\"maxLength\":4096,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"withheld\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"question\",\"abstained\"],\"title\":\"QuestionResult\",\"type\":\"object\"}"
